{"id":"vod_hh_75650","vodId":"75650","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"玻璃假面","name_cn":"玻璃假面","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第51集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/10679b97a8f2db36e7b53d45efe2620b.jpg"},"summary":"北岛玛雅（胜生真沙子 配音）是一个各方面看都很普通的少女，她家境贫穷，和母亲蜗居在店铺街的小二楼里。可是，一旦站到了舞台上，玛雅就会绽放出耀眼的光芒。无论什么样的剧本，只要看过一遍，就会牢牢记住其中的台词，拥有着这样能力的玛雅被当红明星月影千草（中西妙子 配音）相中了，玛雅加入了月影老师所在的月影剧团。初涉演艺界的玛雅获得了巨大的成功，同时也认识了另一剧团的樱小路优（三矢雄二 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-07-17 18:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nellA4le/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerrK4we/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAzykBb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZx5Mvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKNMqre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQlVz7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6lk17e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejjyrWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejjyrze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/meppGA1e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXv3Wlb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyBRjwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGJG0Qb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/meppGAre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOjQKGe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0N4KGb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDDBgYb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen0D1Db/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1